      "created_at": "2017-08-08T14:21:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"carnilius\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> carnilius:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You mean \"different\", correct? Each Dahan is not doing damage as the second one does not have a different target.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oops, yes, I fixed my comment.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"carnilius\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> carnilius:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Have a thematic explanation of why?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Here's what Eric says:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Eric R\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Eric R:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thematically, it's that the Dahan are doing scattered, widespread raiding; it's not enough to wipe out even a Town, but can hit as many Invaders as there are Dahan. (Basically, \"1 Damage to each Invader, to a maximum of the # of Dahan in target land\", but that's a little clunkier.)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
