      "raw": "[quote=\"carnilius\"]\n You mean &quot;different&quot;, correct? Each Dahan is not doing damage as the second one does not have a different target.\n[/quote]\nOops, yes, I fixed my comment.\n[quote=\"carnilius\"]\n  Have a thematic explanation of why?  \n[/quote]\nHere&#39;s what Eric says: \n\n \n[quote=\"Eric R\"]\n  Thematically, it&#39;s that the Dahan are doing scattered, widespread raiding; it&#39;s not enough to wipe out even a Town, but can hit as many Invaders as there are Dahan. (Basically, &quot;1 Damage to each Invader, to a maximum of the # of Dahan in target land&quot;, but that&#39;s a little clunkier.)\n[/quote]\n \n",
